# Test Lotto API endpoints

### Get all draws (paginated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/summary/draws?page=1&per_page=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get draws by date
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/summary/draws/2024-01-01
Accept: application/json

###

### Get prediction for a lotto type
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/prediction/lotto_649
Accept: application/json

###

### Get prediction with optional draw date and count
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/prediction/lotto_649?draw_date=2024-01-01&count=5
Accept: application/json

###
